    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A bridge has crossed the Sacramento River at Butte City since the 1880s, and a new State Route 162 bridge is under construction as of 2023.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Butte_City%2C_Glenn_County%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The surrounding landscape is dominated by rice paddies, walnut orchards, alfalfa fields, and corn farms that feed the regional market.",
